y duel  number five the fallen he was the first  decepticon and appears to be the most  powerful of them all as of the second  movie  his major purpose was to eliminate all  life on earth by destroying the sun  and to do this he turned against his  brothers the other primes who were  unable to beat him even  with their combined strength he  threatened the entire planet upon his  return and during his appearance in the  pyramids  he easily destroyed armies of military  tanks and aircraft of humans  he is indeed one of the most powerful  transformers ever as a prime  as none could defeat him but another  prime which is why he earns the number 5  spot  and optimus prime was only able to do so  after combining with jet fire  and also for the fact that megatron's  the fallen was very old and  was kind of weakened after years of  inactivity  number 4 optimus prime he is the leader  of the autobots and one of the most  powerful transformers ever  although he hides his power in most of  his fights and only shows it in true  fits of rage like when he battle  megatron starscream and grinder all at  once besting them all at once  but only being killed after he was  distracted looking for some with wiki  optimus has defeated infernicus has  defeated megatron  sentinel prime grimlock lockdown driller  the fallen  and all the others in the entries below  him so he deserves this spot  he was however unable to best three  others that will be shown  next number three dragonstorm  dragonstorm is a beastly three-headed  dragon the mighty gestalt form of the  legendary twelfth knights of econ who  oppose quintessa  at times dragon storm is only formed  from dragonicus and storm rain  it is logically unclear why the knights  could still transform into the same  dragon  after nemesis prime murdered one or two  of them but maybe the dragon could be a  little bit smaller after such deductions  and since the knights were able to stop  nemesis prime which is in fact  optimus prime and even n